  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to quality of arts in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Teatro Avenida, a theatre to implement a project &#x201c;Sabura Museum and Theatre School .The centre will provide a space, particularly for young people, to support skills development in storytelling, art, theatre, dance and music traditions.  This meets a core objective of the Embassy&#x2019;s Mission Strategy to support youth education and development, including leveraging arts and culture, to build a deeper and broader bilateral relationship. The funds will be provided under Outcome 2: Supporting knowledge exchange and innovative climate smart and gender sensitive initiatives, to build decentralised systems that are responsive to the needs of the furthest behind, thereby reducing humanitarian need and building resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
